WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Habib AI Studio: a home for your campaign strategy, copy, and visuals.
This walkthrough uses the offline sample workspace.

00:07.000 --> 00:18.000
Start with your brand. Add your audience, voice, and palette.

00:18.000 --> 00:32.000
Create a project. Introduce your product and choose a goal and channel.

00:32.000 --> 00:45.000
In live mode, Claude creates the strategy, audience insights, and concepts.
The public demo simulates this step without an API call.

00:45.000 --> 00:54.000
Explore hooks, headlines, and ad copy in your brand's voice.
Review details and claims before publishing.

00:54.000 --> 01:05.000
Claude constructs image prompts. A separate image model renders visuals.
The sample workspace reuses existing demo artwork.

01:05.000 --> 01:12.000
Save the campaign and export your creative package.
Keep your strategy, copy, and images together.

01:12.000 --> 01:15.000
Your next creative direction starts at mdhabiburrahman.xyz.
